@67B9D When it comes down to comprehending God's invisible hand governing the universe, I couldn't help but think that divine intervention implies an aspect of unpredictability which gets lost on attempting pure factual analyses.Perhaps,then true understanding requires considering multiple levels –human comprehension guided by revelation coupled thru the light given Scripture verses scientific observations combining facts within contextual framework shared? Would you say that approach blends best possible perspectives, offering complete worldview despite differences between each component?

